# Keep the Docker build context clean — the deploy host (/srv/apps/muneral)
# accumulates a host node_modules + lockfile residue from `prisma migrate deploy`
# run before the image build; copying those into the image breaks pnpm's
# deps-status check inside `pnpm --filter ... build` (runDepsStatusCheck → install exit 1).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
*.log
.DS_Store
**/coverage
**/.next
.worktrees
